-function [finalMask, Tall] = plot_combined_pareto_base(ax, E, Tp, plotColors, caseMarkers, accentColor, xBounds, yBounds)
-%PLOT_COMBINED_PARETO_BASE All-case sample cloud + per-case frontiers + combined frontier.
